Bundled third-party code
------------------------

src/StackWalker/
    StackWalker by Jochen Kalmbach (djohls). Bundled licence file is
    BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2005 - 2019.
    See src/StackWalker/LICENSE for the full terms.

src/MinHook/
    MinHook by Tsuda Kageyu, used under a 2-clause BSD licence.
    NOTE: the upstream clone did NOT vendor MinHook's LICENSE.txt - only the
    sources and a .gitkeep placeholder are present. If you redistribute this
    tree, fetch the licence text from https://github.com/TsudaKageyu/minhook
    and add it here. The git submodule declaration also means a plain
    `git clone` of katalash/ModEngine without --recursive leaves this
    directory empty; use --recursive, or just use the files already in src/.

src/ImGui/
    Dear ImGui by Omar Cornut, MIT licensed. Not required by the 1.6 fix
    build; it is retained only so the full upstream tree stays intact. The
    upstream tree likewise ships no third-party licence text for it.

src/LeoSpecial/
    Not part of upstream. Added by this project as a minimal stub because
    ModLoader.cpp includes LeoSpecial/LeoSpecial.h but upstream never vendored
    the library. Every use of it in upstream is commented out or dead code.


